sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Owner
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  C->>A: GET /api/auth/security-questions
  A-->>C: 7 questions
  U->>C: Fill form, accept terms, Create workspace
  C->>C: Check password rules and match
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/register
  A->>A: Validate fields, password policy, question
  A->>D: SELECT user WHERE lower(email) = …
  D-->>A: none
  A->>A: bcrypt hash password and answer
  A->>D: INSERT user with new Warehouse ID
  D-->>A: user row
  A->>A: Sign JWT (7 days)
  A-->>C: 201 user, Warehouse ID, token
  C->>C: Store token and user
  C-->>U: Dashboard
